Short:        Small example of IrisGL(TM) using AGL
Author:       Jason Weber
Uploader:     jason belvoir-arl-irisgt army mil
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This example includes an executable complied from IrisGL(TM) compatible
source.  This same executable has been compiled on an SGI without
modification.

This archive contains:
box.c     (example of IrisGL(TM) source)
box       (020/881 executable)
agl.guide (the library's doc)


See agl*.readme for an explanation of the AGL library.
